  "verseCount": 17,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOS 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwibeeja beeja kūlwa kūkīla mongo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha ntondo yaho ī dilū, ū Yoshwa na a Baisilaeli a bose būbūūka kwīnga ī Shitimu, beegeela kū mongo gwa Yolodani, būūkatūūla ng'hambī kwenūko aho bataalī kūkīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho jabīta shikū idatū a bagunanhi būbīta pye a hose ū mu ng'hambī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "būja bakūbakomigaga a banhū balībawīla, “Ūlū ng'ūbabona a bagabīji, a ba lūganda lwa Lawī, baalībūūcha ī lisandīko lya būlagane bo ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wing'we, shing'wigelile kwīnga aho mukwikalaga mulīlondeele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu gīko hū mukūdeeba ūko mujile, nguno mutaalī ū kūshika a mapandī genaya na kamò yaya. Gwike īkūng'wigeleelwa kūbiza kūle nalyo ī lisandīko, bū kūle wa kwegeela ha kilomita īmò;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kwegeela ha kilomita īmò:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, miita ja kwegeela ha magana kenda.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " yaya ū kūlyegeela bo mumo bbihī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yoshwa ūbawīla a banhū gīkī, “Iyeejagi nguno ū SEEBA akwīta mihayo mitaale ū mu bing'we ī ntondo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bagabīji nabo ūbawīla ū Yoshwa gīkī, “Lībūūchagi ī lisandīko lya būlagane muje nalyo mubatongeele a banhū;” ng'hana būlībūūcha būtongela ū kū būtongi wa banhū.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "SEEBA kūng'wisagīja Yoshwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Yoshwa gīkī, “Ī lelo yenīyī nakwandya kūkūgūngūhya ū mu miso ga Baisilaeli bose, bamane gīkī nalī hamò nang'ho gīt'ūmo naalī hamò na Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bagabīji abo bakalībūūchaga ī lisandīko lya būlagane bawīlage gīkī, ‘Ūlū mulashike a ha minzī ga mongo gwa Yolodani, ingīlagi ū mu mongo ng'wīmīīle mo.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yoshwa ūbawīla a Baisilaeli gīkī, “Egeelagi aha mudegeleke ī mihayo ya ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno hū mukūdeeba gīkī ū Mulungu mpanga alī hamò ning'we, na gīkī akūbapeeja bang'wīngīle gete pye a Bakanaani, na a Bahītī, Bahīvī, Bapelizi, Bagiligashi, Baamooli, na a Bayebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulīlībona ī lisandīko lya būlagane bo ng'wa SEEBA wa sī yose, līkūja līmutongeelile līkashike ū kū mongo gwa Yolodani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ī haha solanhyagi banhū kūfuma ū mu ng'anda ikūmi na ibīlī ja Baisilaeli, munhū ūmò būlī lūganda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bagabīji abo balībūūkije ī lisandīko lya ng'wa SEEBA, ū SEEBA wa sī yose, ūlū būgakuumya dūhū a minzī ga mongo gwa Yolodani na mhambala jabo, a minzī ga mongo gwenūyo gakūlekaana, ayo galīfuma kū sī ja magūlya gakwīīma, gikīge gītī lūgegu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūkīla mongo gwa Yolodani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a banhū aho baasambūla ī ng'hambī kwandya lūgendo lwa kūjūkīla mongo gwa Yolodani, a bagabīji abo baalī balībūūkije ī lisandīko lya būlagane būtongela kū būtongi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mongo gwenūyo gūkikalaga gookalile pa gūtaalile, pyī ī likanza lya shikū ja magesa. Alīyo a bagabīji, abo baalī balībūūkije ī lisandīko lya būlagane, aho bashika a ha mongo, ī mhambala jabo aho jagakuumya a minzī ga Yolodani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a minzī ayo gafumaga kū sī ja magūlya gooya ū kūhūūma, gilūndīka ilūndo itaale kūle ū kwīnga a henaho; bbihī na nzengo gwa Adamu, kūīlīīla ipandī liitanagwa Zaletani. A minzī ayo gahūūmaga kūja kū Nyanza ya Alaba (h'ī Nyanza ya Munhu), a gene gūja gete; gūbiza gatīnīka. Na lūūlū a banhū būbīta hasī nyūūmu, h'ipandī lyilolile nū nzengo gwa Yeliko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bagabīji abo baalī balībūūkije ī lisandīko lya būlagane o ng'wa SEEBA bīmīīla hasī nyūūmu a ha gatī gatī ya mongo gwa Yolodani, ū kūnū a Baisilaeli bakūbītaga, kūshisha pyī ī lihanga lyūgūkīla ū mongo gwa Yolodani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
